hadiths[1243]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5499","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Samundar ka pani paak hai."
"5500","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mard ka pani safed hai aur aurat ka pani peela; phir jab donon jama hon aur mard ki mani aurat ki mani par ghalib aaye to Allah ke izn se nar paida hota hai; aur jab aurat ki mani mard ki mani par ghalib aaye to Allah ke izn se maada paida hoti hai."
"5501","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mard ka pani gaarha safed hai aur aurat ka pani patla peela hai; phir in mein se jo aage barhe bachcha us se mushabeh hota hai."
"5502","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zamzam ka pani jis ke liye piya jaye us ke liye hai."
"5503","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hukmaran ke maalon mein se jo tumhein Allah de baghair mangne aur lalach ke to use khao aur maal banao."
"5504","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is maal mein se jo tumhein Allah de baghair mangne aur lalach ke to use lo aur maal banao ya sadqa karo; aur jo na ho to apne aap ko us ke peeche na lagao."
"5505","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo mujh par iman nahi laya jo pait bhar kar soye aur us ka parosi us ke pehlu mein bhooka ho halanke wo use janta ho."
"5506","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum jama nahi hoti phir Allah ke zikr aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par durood ke baghair muntashir hoti magar murdar se zyada badbudaar se uthti hai."
"5507","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum zikr par jama nahi hoti aur us se muntashir hoti magar un se kaha jata hai: Utho bakhshe hue."
"5508","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum jama nahi hoti aur Allah ke zikr ke baghair muntashir hoti magar goya wo gadhe ke murdar se muntashir hui; aur wo majlis un par hasrat hogi."
"5509","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum Allah ke gharon mein se kisi ghar mein jama nahi hoti jo Allah ki kitab parhti hai aur aapas mein us ka dars karti hai magar un par sukoon utarta hai, rehmat unhein dhaanp leti hai, farishte unhein gher lete hain aur Allah un ka zikr un mein karta hai jo us ke paas hain."
"5510","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum majlis mein jama nahi hoti aur muntashir hoti hai aur Allah ka zikr nahi karti aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par durood nahi bhejti magar un ki majlis qayamat ke din un par hasrat hogi."
"5511","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main us ke liye us ki is jihad mein duniya aur aakhirat mein us ke deenaron ke siwa kuch nahi pata jo us ne naam liye."
"5512","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe pasand nahi ke Uhud mere liye sona ban jaye jo mere paas teen se zyada deenar thehre siwaye deenar ke jo main qarz ke liye rok lun."
"5513","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe pasand nahi ke mere paas sona ho aur mujh par teen guzrein aur mere paas us mein se kuch ho siwaye kuch ke jo main qarz ada karne mein rok lun."
"5514","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe pasand nahi ke shakhs ko salam karun halanke wo namaz parh raha ho; aur agar wo mujhe salam kare to use jawab dunga."
"5515","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe pasand nahi ke main insaan ki naql karun halanke mere liye aisa aur aisa ho."
"5516","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Banda bande se Allah ke liye mohabbat nahi karta magar us ka Rab use izzat deta hai."
"5517","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere nazdeek Abu Bakr se bara ehsan wala koi nahi; unhon ne apni jaan aur maal se meri madad ki aur mujhe apni beti ka nikah diya."
"5518","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi sood se zyada nahi karta magar us ke muamle ka anjaam kami ki taraf hota hai."
"5519","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi jannat mein dakhil nahi hota jo pasand kare ke duniya ki taraf wapas aaye agarche us ke liye zameen par jo hai sab ho siwaye shaheed ke; kyunke wo tamanna karta hai ke wapas aaye aur das baar qatl ho jab wo izzat dekhta hai."
"5520","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bete ya baap ne jo bachaya wo us ke asba ke liye hai jo bhi ho."
"5521","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi rag nahi pharakti na aankh magar gunah se; aur Allah us se zyada door karta hai."
"5522","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya ne aakhirat mein se utna liya jaise sui samundar mein duboyi gayi us ke pani mein se le."
"5523","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe tum par faqr ka darr nahi; lekin mujhe tum par kasrat ka darr hai. Aur mujhe tum par khata ka darr nahi; lekin mujhe tum par jaan-boojh ka darr hai."
"5524","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main nahi janta ke Tubba Nabi thay ya nahi? Aur main nahi janta ke Zulqarnain Nabi thay ya nahi? Aur main nahi janta ke hudood apne walon ke liye kaffare hain ya nahi?"
"5525","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne kisi cheez ko aise tawajjuh se nahi suna jaise achchi aawaz wale Nabi ko jo Quran khush-aawazi se buland parhta hai."
"5526","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main muamle ko us se zyada jaldi wala nahi samajhta."
"5527","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ne takabbur nahi kiya jis ke saath us ka khadim khaye, bazaaron mein gadhe par sawaar ho aur bakri ko bandhe aur us ka doodh dohe."
"5528","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum subah ko jitna roshan karo wo ajr mein azeem hai."
"5529","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tehband mein jo takhnon se neeche ho wo aag mein hai."
"5530","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ki zyada miqdar nasha de us ki thori haram hai."
"5531","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis se faraq nasha de us mein se hatheli bhar haram hai."
"5532","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pachhne lagwane wale ko jo lage use paani bharne wale oont ko khilao."
"5533","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apni dhaar se lage use khao; aur jo apne pehlu se lage aur maar de wo gundala hua hai; pas use na khao."
"5534","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi subah meri nahi hoti magar main us mein Allah taala se sau baar bakhshish mangta hun."
"5535","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tum ne apni biwi ko khilaya wo tumhare liye sadqa hai; jo tum ne apne bete ko khilaya wo tumhare liye sadqa hai; jo tum ne apne khadim ko khilaya wo tumhare liye sadqa hai; aur jo tum ne apne aap ko khilaya wo tumhare liye sadqa hai."
"5536","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum kitne pakeeza sheher ho aur mujhe kitne mehboob ho; aur agar meri qaum mujhe tum se na nikalti to tumhare siwa kahin na rehta. Ye Makka se kaha."
"5537","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sabz aasman ne saya nahi kiya na gard-aalood zameen ne uthaya Abu Zarr se zyada sachche lehje wale ko."
"5538","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sabz aasman ne saya nahi kiya na gard-aalood zameen ne uthaya Abu Zarr se zyada sachche aur wafa-daar lehje wale ko jo Isa Ibn Maryam se mushabeh hain."
"5539","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main nahi samajhta ke falan aur falan hamare deen mein se kuch jante hain."
"5540","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ne apni biwi ko jo diya wo sadqa hai."
"5541","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghar walon ko narmi nahi di jati magar unhein faida deti hai."
"5542","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein nahi deta na rokta; main taqseem karne wala hun, jahan hukm diya gaya rakhta hun."
"5543","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bande ke donon qadam Allah ki raah mein gard-aalood nahi hote magar Allah ne us par aag haram ki."
"5544","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ghar salan se khaali nahi jis mein sirka ho."
"5545","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs kisi shakhs ko kafir nahi kehta magar un mein se aik par laut-ta hai."
"5546","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kisi ne kabhi aisa khana nahi khaya jo is se behtar ho ke wo apne haath ki kamayi se khaye; aur beshak Allah ke Nabi Dawood apne haath ki kamayi se khate thay."
"5547","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya aakhirat mein aisi hai jaise tum mein se koi samundar ki taraf chale aur us mein apni ungli dakhil kare; phir jo us mein se nikle wo duniya hai."
"5548","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zilhajja ke das dinon mein amal us se behtar nahi aur na Allah ki raah mein jihad, siwaye shakhs ke jo apni jaan aur maal se khatra lekar nikle aur us mein se kuch lekar wapas na aaye."
"5549","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pucha gaya us ke baare mein, yani qayamat, se zyada jaanne wala nahi puchne wale se; aur main tumhein us ki nishaniyon ki khabar dunga: jab laundi apni malika ko jane to ye us ki nishaniyon mein se hai; jab nange nangay pair logon ke sardar hon to ye us ki nishaniyon mein se hai; jab be-zaban maweshiyon ke charwahe imaarton mein lambe hon to ye us ki nishaniyon mein se hai. Ghaib ki paanch mein jinhein Allah ke siwa koi nahi janta: Beshak Allah ke paas qayamat ka ilm hai, aayat."
"5550","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe masjdon ko uncha banane ka hukm nahi diya gaya."
"5551","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe hukm nahi diya gaya ke jab bhi peshaab karun wuzu karun; aur agar karta to sunnat hoti."
"5552","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo maine tumhein hukm diya use lo, aur jis se maine tumhein mana kiya us se ruko."
"5553","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tumhare liye roke wo khao."
"5554","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main ne tumhein sawaar nahi kiya lekin Allah ne tumhein sawaar kiya; aur main Allah ki qasam Insha Allah kisi qasam par halaf nahi leta aur us ke siwa behtar dekhta magar apni qasam ka kaffara deta hun aur jo behtar hai use karta hun."
"5555","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main aur duniya aur main aur tasveerain."
"5556","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum jo main kehta hun use un se zyada sunne wale nahi, magar wo mujhe kuch jawab dene ki taqat nahi rakhte."
"5557","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum hauz par mere paas aane walon mein se aik laakh mein se aik hissa nahi."
"5558","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne koi beemari nahi utari magar us ki dawa utari."
"5559","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne koi beemari nahi utari magar us ki shifa utari."
"5560","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne Taurat mein na Injeel mein Umm-ul-Quran jaisa kuch nahi utara; wo saat dohrayi jane wali aayatein hain; wo mere aur mere bande ke darmiyan taqseem hain aur mere bande ke liye wo hai jo us ne manga."
"5561","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah aasman se barkat mein se jo utarta hai magar logon mein se giroh us se kafir ho jata hai; Allah baarish utarta hai to wo kehte hain: Falan falan sitare se."
"5562","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne bande par naimat nahi di aur us ne us par Allah ki hamd ki magar wo hamd us naimat se behtar thi.. ..."
"5563","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne bande par naimat nahi di aur us ne kaha: Alhamdulillah, magar jo us ne diya wo us se behtar tha jo us ne liya."
"5564","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tumhara dil na-pasand kare use chhor do."
"5565","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo khoon bahaye aur us par Allah ka naam liya gaya ho use khao; daant aur nakhun nahi. Aur main tumhein is ke baare mein batata hun: raha daant to haddi hai aur raha nakhun to Habsha ki chhuri hai."
"5566","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhein jo kuch dun na rokun; main to khazanchi hun, jahan hukm diya gaya rakhta hun."
"5567","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kisi ko utni takleef nahi di gayi jitni mujhe di gayi."
"5568","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kisi ko utni takleef nahi di gayi jitni mujhe Allah mein di gayi."
"5569","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi ehram bandhne wala talbiya nahi kehta na takbeer kehne wala takbeer kehta magar use jannat ki khushkhabri di jati hai."
"5570","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se aik ka kiya haal hai jo apne Rab ke saamne khara hota hai aur us ke saamne thookta hai? Kiya wo pasand karta hai ke us ka saamna kiya jaye aur us ke chehre mein thooka jaye? Phir agar tum mein se koi thookay to apne bayen ya apne qadam ke neeche thookay; phir agar na paye to aise kahe, yani apne kapre mein."
"5571","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaumon ka kiya haal hai jin se aaj qatl barh gaya yahan tak ke unhon ne aulad qatl ki? Khabardar, tumhare behtareen mushrikeen ke bete hain. Khabardar, aulad qatl na karo. Khabardar, aulad qatl na karo. Har jaan fitrat par paida hoti hai; wo us par rehti hai yahan tak ke us ki zaban us ki taraf se bole; phir us ke walidain use Yahudi banate hain ya Nasrani."
"5572","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaumon ka kiya haal hai jinhon ne aisa aur aisa kaha? Lekin main namaz parhta hun aur sota hun, roza rakhta hun aur iftar karta hun aur auraton se nikah karta hun; pas jo meri sunnat se be-raghbati kare wo mujh se nahi."
"5573","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaumon ka kiya haal hai jo us cheez se paaki ikhtiyar karte hain jo main karta hun? Allah ki qasam, main un mein Allah ko sab se zyada jaanne wala hun aur us se sab se zyada darne wala hun."
"5574","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaumon ka kiya haal hai jo apni namazon mein apni nazrein aasman ki taraf uthate hain? Wo is se zaroor baaz aayen warna un ki nazrein uchak li jayengi."
"5575","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un logon ka kiya haal hai jo namaz mein apne haathon se phenkte hain goya wo tez ghoron ki dumen hain? Kiya tum mein se aik ko kafi nahi ke apna haath apni raan par rakhe aur apne dayen aur bayen salam kare?"
"5576","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mardon ka kiya haal hai jo wisal karte hain? Tum meri tarah nahi ho; Allah ki qasam, agar mere liye maheena barhaya jata to wisal karta aisa wisal jo gehrayi mein jane walon ki gehrayi chhor de."
"5577","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne koi Nabi nahi bheja magar us ne apni ummat ko Dajjal se daraya; use Nooh ne daraya aur un ke baad nabiyon ne. Aur wo tum mein niklega; phir jo us ke muamle mein tum par chhupa rahe wo tum par nahi chhupega ke tumhara Rab kaana nahi aur wo dayen aankh se kaana hai goya us ki aankh ubhri hui angoor hai. Khabardar, Allah ne tum par tumhare khoon aur maal haram kiye hain jaise tumhare is din ki hurmat tumhare is sheher mein tumhare is maheene mein. Khabardar, kiya maine pahunchaya? Ae Allah, gawah reh, teen baar. Afsos tum par! Dekho, mere baad kafir ban kar wapas na aana ke tum mein se baaz baaz ki gardanein marein."
"5578","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne koi Nabi nahi bheja magar us ne apni ummat ko kaane jhoote Dajjal se daraya. Khabardar, wo kaana hai aur tumhara Rab kaana nahi; us ki dono aankhon ke darmiyan kafir likha hai jise har momin parhega."
"5579","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne koi Nabi nahi bheja na koi khalifa janashin banaya magar us ke liye do raaz-daan thay: aik raaz-daan jo use maroof ka hukm deta aur us par ubharta aur aik raaz-daan jo use shar ka hukm deta aur us par ubharta. Pas mehfooz wo hai jise Allah mehfooz rakhe."
"5580","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne koi Nabi nahi bheja na us ke baad koi khalifa tha magar us ke liye do raaz-daan thay: aik raaz-daan jo use maroof ka hukm deta aur munkar se rokta aur aik raaz-daan jo use kharabi mein kotahi nahi karta. Pas jo bure raaz-daan se bacha wo bacha liya gaya."
"5581","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne koi Nabi nahi bheja magar us ne bakriyan charayin; aur main unhein ahle Makka ke liye qarateeron par charata tha."
"5582","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo us ki zakaat ada karne tak pahunche aur zakaat de wo khazana nahi."
"5583","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Naaf aur ghutne ke darmiyan satr hai."
"5584","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mashriq aur maghrib ke darmiyan qibla hai."
"5585","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Donon phoonkon ke darmiyan chalis hain; phir Allah aasman se pani utarega aur wo aise ugenge jaise sabzi ugti hai. Aur insaan mein se koi cheez nahi magar bosida hoti hai siwaye aik haddi ke jo dumchi ki haddi hai; usi se paida kiya gaya aur usi se qayamat ke din jora jayega."
"5586","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere ghar aur mimbar ke darmiyan jannat ke baghon mein se bagh hai."
"5587","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere ghar aur mimbar ke darmiyan jannat ke baghon mein se bagh hai; aur mera mimbar mere hauz par hai."
"5588","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Adam ki paidaish se qayamat qayam hone tak Dajjal se bara muamla nahi."
"5589","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Madina ke donon kinaron ke darmiyan haram hai."
"5590","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat ke darwazon mein se do kiwaron ke darmiyan chalis saal ki musafat hai; aur us par din zaroor aayega jab wo bhara hua hoga."
"5591","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag mein kafir ke dono kandhon ke darmiyan tez sawaar ke liye teen din ki musafat hai."
"5592","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere hauz ke donon kinaron ke darmiyan Sana aur Madina ke darmiyan jitna ya Madina aur Uman ke darmiyan jitna faasla hai; us mein sone aur chandi ke aaftabe dikhte hain aasman ke taron ki tadaad ya zyada."
"5593","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mujhe kiya hukm dete ho? Tum mujhe hukm dete ho ke main use hukm dun ke apna haath tumhare munh mein dale aur use kaate jaise oont kaatta hai? Apna haath aage barhao yahan tak ke wo use kaate phir use kheench lo."
"5594","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala mein do ne mohabbat nahi ki magar un mein afzal wo tha jo apne saathi se zyada mohabbat karta tha."
"5595","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tehband mein jo takhnon ke neeche ho wo aag mein hai."
"5596","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haji ke oont ka pair nahi uthta na haath rakhta magar Allah taala us se us ke liye neki likhta hai ya us se burayi mitata hai ya us se darja buland karta hai."
"5597","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine apne baad mardon par auraton se zyada nuqsan-deh fitna nahi chhora."
"5598","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum Ali se kiya chahte ho? Tum Ali se kiya chahte ho? Tum Ali se kiya chahte ho? Beshak Ali mujh se hai aur main us se hun; aur wo mere baad har momin ka wali hai."
"5599","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Suraj nahi nikalta aur Allah ki makhlooq mein se kuch baaqi nahi rehta magar Allah ki hamd se tasbeeh karta hai siwaye shaitanon aur Bani Adam ke bewaqoofon ke."
"5600","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi halal se sadqa nahi karta aur Allah halal ke siwa qabool nahi karta magar Rehman use apne dayen se leta hai; agarche khajoor ho to Rehman ki hatheli mein barhti hai yahan tak ke pahar se bari ho jaye jaise tum mein se koi apne bachhere ya oont ke bachche ko barhata hai."
"5601","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum kiya kehte ho? Agar tumhari duniya ka muamla hai to tumhara muamla; aur agar tumhare deen ka muamla hai to meri taraf."
"5602","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum shaheed ke baare mein kiya kehte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki raah mein qatl. Farmaya: Phir meri ummat ke shaheed kam honge. Jo Allah ki raah mein qatl ho wo shaheed hai, jo Allah ki raah mein mare wo shaheed hai, pait wala shaheed hai, taaoon-zada shaheed hai aur doobne wala shaheed hai."
"5603","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah mein do ne mohabbat nahi ki aur un ke darmiyan judayi nahi hoti magar gunah se jo un mein se aik kare."
"5604","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman shakhs masjdon ko namaz aur zikr ke liye aadi nahi banata magar Allah us se khush hota hai jab se wo apne ghar se nikalta hai jaise ghair-hazir ke ghar wale apne ghair-hazir se khush hote hain jab wo un ke paas aaye."
"5605","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne koi Nabi wafat nahi diya magar wahin dafn kiya gaya jahan us ki rooh qabz ki gayi."
"5606","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne bande ki maut kisi zameen mein nahi banayi magar us ke liye us mein hajat banayi."
"5607","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum majlis mein nahi baithti jis mein wo Allah taala ka zikr nahi karti na apne Nabi par durood bhejti magar un par hasrat hoti hai; phir agar chahe unhein azaab de aur agar chahe unhein bakhsh de."
"5608","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum nahi baithti jo Allah ka zikr karti hai magar farishte unhein gher lete hain, rehmat unhein dhaanp leti hai, un par sukoon utarta hai aur Allah un ka zikr un mein karta hai jo us ke paas hain."
"5609","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum nahi baithti jo Allah taala ka zikr karti hai magar aasman se pukarne wala unhein pukarta hai: Utho bakhshe hue."
"5610","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum nahi baithti jo Allah taala ka zikr karti hai aur khari hoti hai yahan tak ke un se kaha jata hai: Utho, Allah ne tumhare gunah bakhsh diye aur tumhari buraiyan nekiyon se badal dein."
"5611","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tumhare seene mein khatke use chhor do."
"5612","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Suraj kisi insaan par nahi roka gaya siwaye Yusha bin Noon par un raaton mein jab wo Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf chale."
"5613","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yahudiyon ne tum se kisi cheez par hasad nahi kiya jitna unhon ne salam aur aameen par hasad kiya."
"5614","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman shakhs ka haq nahi jis ke paas kuch ho jis mein wo waseeyat karna chahe ke do raatein guzare magar us ki waseeyat us ke paas likhi hui ho."
"5615","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman shakhs ka haq nahi jis ke paas kuch ho jis mein wo waseeyat kare ke teen raatein guzare magar us ki waseeyat us ke paas likhi hui ho."
"5616","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman shakhs ke dil mein Allah ki raah mein ghubar nahi milta magar Allah ne us par aag haram ki."
"5617","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs apne ghar se ilm talash karte hue nahi nikalta magar Allah us ke liye jannat ka raasta aasan karta hai."
"5618","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Takhnon se peeche jo ho wo aag mein hai."
"5619","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ammar ko do muamalon ke darmiyan ikhtiyar nahi diya gaya magar unhon ne un mein se zyada durust ko ikhtiyar kiya."
"5620","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do bhooke bheriye bakriyon mein chhore jayen wo un ke liye us se zyada fasaad nahi karte jitna aadmi ka maal aur izzat par hirs us ke deen ke liye hai."
"5621","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine bhalayi aur burayi mein aaj jaise kabhi nahi dekha; mere liye jannat aur aag tasweer ki gayin yahan tak ke maine unhein deewar ke peeche dekha."
"5622","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine aag jaisa nahi dekha jis se bhaagne wala soye na jannat jaisa jis ka talabgar soye."
"5623","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine koi manzar nahi dekha magar qabar us se zyada haulnak hai."
"5624","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine aqal aur deen mein naqis se aqal wale par tum se zyada ghalib koi nahi dekha. Raha aqal ka nuqsan to do auraton ki gawahi aik mard ki gawahi hai; aur raha deen ka nuqsan to tum mein se aik Ramazan mein roza chhorti hai aur din guzarti hai namaz nahi parhti."
"5625","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ham ne ghabrahat mein se kuch nahi dekha; hum ne use samundar paya."
"5626","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bande ko sabr se behtar aur wasee rizq nahi diya gaya."
"5627","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare kiye mein se jo maine dekha wo mujh par qayam raha yahan tak ke mujhe darr hua ke tum par likh diya jayega; aur agar tum par likh diya jata to tum us par qayam na rakhte. Pas namaz parho ae logo apne gharon mein; kyunke shakhs ki behtareen namaz us ke ghar mein hai siwaye farz namaz ke."
"5628","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jibreel mujhe parosi ki waseeyat karte rahe yahan tak ke maine samjha ke wo use waris banayenge."
"5629","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khaibar ke luqme ne har saal meri taraf lautna nahi chhora yahan tak ke ye meri shah-rag katne ka waqt tha."
"5630","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman shakhs Allah se teen baar jannat nahi mangta magar jannat kehti hai: Ae Allah, use jannat mein dakhil kar. Aur koi Musalman shakhs Allah se teen baar aag se panaah nahi mangta magar aag kehti hai: Ae Allah, use mujh se panaah de."
"5631","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara kiya haal hai ke apne haathon se ishara karte ho goya wo tez ghoron ki dumen hain? Jab tum mein se koi salam kare to apne saathiyon ki taraf mutawajjeh ho aur apne haath se ishara na kare."
"5632","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din momin ke meezan mein husn-e-akhlaq se bhari koi cheez nahi; kyunke Allah taala fahhash bad-zaban se bughz rakhta hai."
"5633","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum hidayat ke baad gumrah nahi hoti jis par thi magar use jhagda diya gaya."
"5634","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kisi qaum mein sood aur zina zahir nahi hota magar wo apne aap par Allah ki saza halal karte hain."
"5635","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi par harj nahi agar wusat paye ke juma ke din ke liye apne kaam ke kapron ke siwa do kapre banaye."
"5636","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen par koi nahi jo kahe La ilaha illallah, Allahu Akbar, La hawla wa la quwwata illa billah magar us ki khataen mitayi jati hain agarche samundar ke jhag jaisi hon."
"5637","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen par koi Musalman nahi jo Allah se dua se dua kare magar Allah use ata karta hai ya us se us jaisi burayi pher deta hai jab tak wo gunah ya rehem torne se dua na kare, jab tak jaldi na kare ke kahe: Maine dua ki aur dua ki aur mujhe jawab nahi diya gaya."
"5638","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen par koi jaan nahi jo mare aur us ke liye Allah ke paas bhalayi ho jo pasand kare ke tumhari taraf wapas aaye aur us ke liye duniya ho siwaye Allah ki raah mein maqtool ke; kyunke wo pasand karta hai ke wapas aaye aur dobara qatl ho jab wo Allah ka sawab dekhta hai."
"5639","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen par saans lene wali koi jaan nahi, yani aaj, jis par sau saal aaye."
"5640","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen par koi qasam nahi jis par main halaf lun aur us ke siwa behtar dekhun magar use karun."
"5641","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Na use sikhaya jab wo jahil tha na use khilaya jab wo bhooka tha."
"5642","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us par kiya hai agar wo us ki khaal se faida uthaye; Allah ne to us ka khana haram kiya hai."
"5643","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum par azl na karne mein harj nahi; kyunke Allah ne muqaddar kar diya hai jo wo qayamat ke din tak paida karne wala hai."
"5644","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ne koi amal nahi kiya jo us ke liye Allah ke azaab se nijaat-dahinda ho Allah ke zikr se zyada."
"5645","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ne namaz, aapas ki sulah aur husn-e-akhlaq se behtar kuch nahi kiya."
"5646","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs ata ka darwaza sadqe ya silay se nahi kholta magar Allah taala us se us ke liye kasrat barhata hai; aur koi shakhs mangne ka darwaza nahi kholta jis se wo kasrat chahe magar Allah taala us se us ke liye kami barhata hai."
"5647","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat mein koi darakht nahi magar us ka tana sone ka hai."
"5648","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda khuloos se La ilaha illallah nahi kehta magar us ke liye aasman ke darwaze khol diye jate hain yahan tak ke Arsh tak pahunch jaye jab tak wo kabeera se bache."
"5649","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne koi Nabi qabz nahi kiya magar us jagah jahan wo dafn hona pasand kare."
"5650","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne kisi jaan ke liye muqaddar nahi kiya ke use paida kare magar wo hone wali hai."
"5651","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rehem mein jo muqaddar hua wo hone wala hai."
"5652","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Janwar mein se jo us ke zinda hote hue kaata jaye wo murdar hai."
"5653","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo thora ho aur kafi ho wo us se behtar hai jo zyada ho aur ghaafil kare."
"5654","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Narmi jis cheez mein ho use khubsurat bana deti hai aur jis cheez se nikaal li jaye use badnuma bana deti hai."
"5655","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fahhash-goi jis cheez mein bhi ho use badnuma bana deti hai aur haya jis cheez mein bhi ho use khubsurat bana deti hai."
"5656","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jahiliyyat mein jo halaf tha use pakro; Islam mein halaf nahi."
"5657","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meeras mein se jo jahiliyyat mein taqseem hui wo jahiliyyat ki taqseem par hai; aur meeras mein se jo Islam ne payi wo Islam ki taqseem par hai."
"5658","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo aam raaste aur jami basti mein ho use aik saal mashhoor karo; phir agar us ka talabgar aaye to use use de do; aur agar na aaye to wo tumhari hai. Aur jo veeran mein ho us mein aur dafeene mein panchwan hissa hai."
"5659","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tum na-pasand karo ke log tum se dekhein use tanha jab akele ho apne aap se na karo."
"5660","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ne apne haath ke amal se zyada pakeeza kamayi nahi kamayi; aur aadmi ne apne aap, apne ghar walon, apne bete aur apne khadim par jo kharch kiya wo sadqa hai."
"5661","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hamare paas kisi ka ehsan nahi magar ham ne us ka badla diya siwaye Abu Bakr ke; kyunke un ka hamare paas ehsan hai jis ka badla Allah unhein qayamat ke din dega. Aur mujhe kisi ke maal ne faida nahi diya jitna Abu Bakr ke maal ne faida diya. Aur agar main dost banata to Abu Bakr ko dost banata; khabardar, tumhare saathi Allah ke dost hain."
"5662","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare is bachche ko kiya hua jo rota hai? Tum ne us ke liye nazar se dam kyun na karwaya?"
"5663","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhein aur buland majlison se kiya? Buland majlison se bacho. Khabardar, nahi to un ka haq ada karo: nazar jhukana, salam ka jawab dena, raasta dikhana aur achchi baat."
"5664","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe tum par aag walon ka zewar kiya dikhta hai, yani lohe ki angoothi."
"5665","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe tum kiya dikhte ho ke apne haath uthaye hue ho goya wo tez ghoron ki dumen hain? Namaz mein sukoon karo."
"5666","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe tum kiya jamaaton mein dikhte ho?"
"5667","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe tum ne taali bajana kyun zyada kiya? Jis ke paas us ki namaz mein kuch aaye wo tasbeeh kahe; kyunke jab wo tasbeeh kahe to us ki taraf mutawajjeh hota hai. Aur taali to auraton ke liye hai."
"5668","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe duniya se kiya! Main duniya mein aise hun jaise sawaar jo darakht ke neeche saya le phir chale aur use chhor de."
"5669","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe duniya se kiya aur duniya ko mujh se kiya! Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, meri aur duniya ki misaal aise sawaar jaisi hai jo garmi ke din chala aur din ki ghari darakht ke neeche saya liya phir chala aur use chhor diya."
"5670","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Nabi nahi mara magar wahin dafn kiya gaya jahan qabz kiya gaya."
"5671","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis raat mujhe sairaan karayi gayi main farishton ki kisi majlis par nahi guzra magar unhon ne kaha: Ae Muhammad, apni ummat ko pachhne lagwane ka hukm do."
"5672","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis raat mujhe sairaan karayi gayi main farishton ki kisi majlis par nahi guzra magar wo sab mujh se kehte thay: Tum par pachhne lagwana lazim hai ae Muhammad."
"5673","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne jis cheez ki surat badli us ki aulad ya nasal nahi hui."
"5674","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ne pait se bura bartan nahi bhara; Ibn Adam ke liye chand luqme kafi hain jo us ki peeth seedhi rakhein. Phir agar zaroori ho to teesra khane ke liye, teesra peene ke liye aur teesra saans ke liye."
"5675","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi insaan nahi magar us ke sar mein lagam hai farishte ke haath mein; phir jab wo aajizi kare to farishte se kaha jata hai us ki lagam uthao; aur jab wo takabbur kare to farishte se kaha jata hai us ki lagam chhor do."
"5676","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi apne maal ki zakaat ada nahi karta magar us ke liye qayamat ke din ganja saanp banaya jayega yahan tak ke us ki gardan ka tauq ban jaye."
"5677","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qarz nahi leta jis se Allah janta hai ke wo use ada karna chahta hai magar Allah us ki taraf se use duniya mein ada karta hai."
"5678","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi dua se dua nahi karta magar Allah use ata karta hai jo us ne manga ya us se us jaisi burayi rokta hai jab tak wo gunah ya rehem torne se dua na kare."
"5679","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi mujhe salam nahi kehta magar Allah meri rooh mujhe lauta deta hai yahan tak ke main use salam ka jawab dun."
"5680","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mominon mein se chalis nahi jo momin ke liye bakhshish mangein magar Allah unhein us mein shafaat de."
"5681","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nabiyon mein se koi Nabi nahi magar use nishaniyon mein se di gayin jin jaisi par insaan iman laye; aur jo mujhe di gayi wo wahi hai jo Allah ne meri taraf wahi ki; pas main ummeed rakhta hun ke qayamat ke din un mein sab se zyada pairwi wala hunga."
"5682","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dilon mein se koi dil nahi magar us ke liye badal hai chand ke badal jaisa; jab chand roshan hota hai to us par badal chha jata hai aur andhera ho jata hai jab wo hat jata hai."
"5683","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein se koi Musalman nahi jis ke teen faut hon jo bulooghat tak na pahunche hon magar Allah use jannat mein dakhil karega un par apni rehmat ke fazl se."
"5684","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein se koi Musalman jaan nahi jise us ka Rab qabz kare jo pasand kare ke tumhari taraf wapas aaye agarche us ke liye duniya aur jo us mein hai ho siwaye shaheedon ke. Aur mera Allah ki raah mein qatl hona mujhe is se zyada mehboob hai ke mere liye oon aur mitti walon ke ghar hon."
"5685","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi imam ya hakim nahi jo apna darwaza hajat-mand, tang-dast aur miskeen par band kare magar Allah aasman ke darwaze us ki tangi, hajat aur miskeeni par band karega."
"5686","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman shakhs nahi jis par farz namaz hazir ho aur wo us ka wuzu, khushu aur ruku achcha kare magar wo us se pehle gunaahon ka kaffara hogi jab tak kabeera na ho; aur ye hamesha hai."
"5687","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman shakhs nahi jo Musalman ki ayadat kare magar Allah sattar hazaar farishte bhejta hai jo us par durood bhejte hain din ki jis ghari mein ho shaam tak aur raat ki jis ghari mein ho subah tak."
"5688","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo apne ghore ke liye jau saaf kare phir use us par latkaye magar Allah us ke liye har daane se neki likhta hai."
"5689","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo wuzu kare aur apna wuzu achcha kare phir namaz parhe magar us ke liye us ke aur doosri namaz ke darmiyan bakhsh diya jata hai yahan tak ke use parhe."
"5690","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo Musalman shakhs ko aisi jagah be-yaar-o-madadgar chhore jahan us ki izzat mein kami ho aur us ki hurmat tooti jaye magar Allah taala use aisi jagah be-yaar-o-madadgar chhorega jahan wo us ki madad pasand kare. Aur koi nahi jo Musalman ki aisi jagah madad kare jahan us ki izzat mein kami ho aur us ki hurmat tooti jaye magar Allah us ki aisi jagah madad karega jahan wo us ki madad pasand kare."
"5691","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jis ki raat mein namaz ho aur us par neend ghalib aa jaye magar Allah taala us ke liye us ki namaz ka ajr likhta hai aur us ki neend us par sadqa hoti hai."
"5692","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi aurat nahi jo apne ghar ke siwa kapre utare magar us ke aur Allah ke darmiyan parda chaak ho jata hai."
"5693","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi ummat nahi magar us mein se baaz aag mein aur baaz jannat mein hai siwaye meri ummat ke; kyunke wo sab jannat mein hai."
"5694","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi ameer nahi magar us ke liye us ke ghar walon mein se do raaz-daan hain: aik raaz-daan jo use maroof ka hukm deta hai aur munkar se rokta hai aur aik raaz-daan jo use kharabi mein kotahi nahi karta. Pas jo us ke shar se bacha wo bacha liya gaya; aur wo un donon mein se jo us par ghalib ho us mein se hai."
"5695","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Das ka koi ameer nahi magar wo qayamat ke din jakra hua laya jayega yahan tak ke adl use khole ya zulm use halak kare."
"5696","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Das ka koi ameer nahi magar wo qayamat ke din laya jayega halanke us ka haath us ki gardan se jakra hua hoga."
"5697","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi ameer nahi jo Musalmanon ke muamle ka zimmedar ho phir un ke liye koshish na kare aur khair-khwahi na kare magar un ke saath jannat mein dakhil nahi hoga."
"5698","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kisi ghar walon par subah bail nahi aata magar wo zaleel hote hain."
"5699","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kisi oont mein nahi magar us ki kohan mein shaitan hai; phir jab un par sawaar ho to Allah taala ki naimat yaad karo jo us ne tum par ki jaisa Allah ne tumhein hukm diya, phir unhein apne liye aadi banao; kyunke sawari to Allah taala deta hai."
"5700","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bani Adam mein koi paida hone wala nahi magar use shaitan chhuta hai jab wo paida hota hai aur wo shaitan ke chhune se cheekhta hua roota hai siwaye Maryam aur un ke bete ke."
"5701","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Basti ya sehra mein teen nahi jin mein namaz qayam na ki jaye magar shaitan un par ghalib aa jata hai; pas tum par jamaat lazim hai; kyunke bheriya alag ko khata hai."
"5702","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi bahar nikalne wala apne ghar se ilm talash mein nahi nikalta magar farishte us ke liye apne par bichhate hain us se raazi hote hue jo wo karta hai yahan tak ke wapas aaye."
"5703","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Banda jo dua kare us se behtar koi dua nahi: Ae Allah, main tujh se duniya aur aakhirat mein aafiyat ka sawal karta hun."
"5704","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi gunah nahi jo zyada laiq ho ke Allah taala us ke wale ke liye duniya mein saza jaldi kare us ke saath jo us ke liye aakhirat mein zakheera kare zulm aur rehem torne se."
"5705","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi gunah nahi jo zyada laiq ho ke Allah taala us ke wale ke liye duniya mein saza jaldi kare us ke saath jo us ke liye aakhirat mein zakheera kare rehem torne, khayanat aur jhoot se. Aur beshak itaat mein sawab mein sab se jaldi rehem jorna hai yahan tak ke ghar wale badkaar hote hain aur un ke maal barhte hain aur un ki tadaad zyada hoti hai jab wo aapas mein milte hain."
"5706","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi sawaar nahi jo apne safar mein Allah aur us ke zikr se tanha ho magar us ka peeche sawaar farishta hota hai; aur jo sher aur us jaisi se tanha ho us ka peeche sawaar shaitan hota hai."
"5707","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jis ke paas maal ho aur wo us ke maal ka haq ada na kare magar us ke liye us ki gardan mein tauq banaya jata hai jo ganja saanp hai; wo us se bhaagta hai aur wo us ka peecha karta hai."
"5708","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman shakhs nahi jo mare aur us ke janaze par chalis mard khare hon jo Allah ke saath kisi ko shareek na karte hon magar Allah unhein us mein shafaat de."
"5709","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman shakhs nahi jis ke apni aulad mein se teen mar jayen jo bulooghat tak na pahunche hon magar Allah use jannat mein dakhil karega un par apni rehmat ke fazl se."
"5710","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo juma ke din paaki kare jaisa hukm diya gaya phir apne ghar se nikle yahan tak ke juma mein aaye aur khamosh rahe yahan tak ke us ki namaz poori ho jaye magar wo us se pehle juma ka kaffara hoga."
"5711","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo apne aap mein barayi kare aur apne chalne mein itraye magar wo Allah taala se is haal mein milega ke wo us par ghusse mein hoga."
"5712","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo apne jism mein zakhm khaye aur use sadqa kare magar Allah us se utna mita dega jitna us ne sadqa kiya."
"5713","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo ilm yaad kare aur use chhupaye magar wo qayamat ke din aag ki lagam dala hua aayega."
"5714","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo dua se dua kare magar us ke liye qabool ki jayegi; ya to us ke liye duniya mein jaldi ki jayegi ya us ke liye aakhirat mein zakheera ki jayegi،........ jab tak wo gunah ya rehem torne se dua na kare ya jaldi na kare ke kahe: Maine apne Rab se dua ki aur us ne mujhe jawab nahi diya."
"5715","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo raasta chale jis mein ilm talash kare magar Allah us ke liye jannat ka raasta aasan kare; aur jis ka amal use peeche kare us ka nasab use aage nahi barhayega."
"5716","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jis par sau namaz parhein magar us ke liye bakhsh diya jayega."
"5717","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo shaam ko beemar ki ayadat kare magar us ke saath sattar hazaar farishte nikalte hain jo us ke liye bakhshish mangte hain subah tak; aur jo subah us ke paas aaye us ke saath sattar hazaar farishte nikalte hain jo us ke liye bakhshish mangte hain shaam tak."
"5718","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo das ya us se zyada ka zimmedar ho magar wo Allah ke paas aayega halanke us ka haath us ki gardan se jakra hua hoga; us ki neki use kholegi ya us ka gunah use jakrega. Us ka awwal malamat hai, darmiyan nadamat hai aur aakhir qayamat ke din ruswayi hai."
"5719","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo apne maal ki zakaat ada na kare magar Allah qayamat ke din us ki gardan mein ganja saanp banayega; aur jo apne Musalman bhai ka maal qasam se kaate wo Allah se is haal mein milega ke wo us par ghusse mein hoga."
"5720","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi ghari nahi jo Ibn Adam par guzre jis mein wo Allah ka zikr na kare magar wo qayamat ke din us par hasrat karega."
"5721","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meezan mein husn-e-akhlaq se bhari koi cheez nahi."
"5722","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi cheez nahi jo mujhe dikhayi na gayi ho magar maine use apne is muqaam mein dekha yahan tak ke jannat aur aag; aur meri taraf wahi ki gayi hai ke tum apni qabron mein aazmaye jaoge Maseeh Dajjal ke fitne jaisa ya us ke qareeb. Tum mein se har aik ke paas aaya jayega aur us se kaha jayega: Tumhara ilm is shakhs ke baare mein kiya hai? Raha momin ya yaqeen wala to kahega: Wo Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain jo hamare paas wazeh dalail aur hidayat lekar aaye; pas ham ne jawab diya, iman laye aur pairwi ki. Wo Muhammad hain, teen baar. To us se kaha jayega: Naik so; ham jaan chuke ke tum us par yaqeen rakhne wale thay. Aur raha munafiq ya shak wala to kahega: Main nahi janta; maine logon ko kuch kehte suna to maine kaha."
"5723","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ko koi cheez nahi pahunchti yahan tak ke kaanta jo use chubhe magar Allah us se us ke liye neki likhta hai aur us se us ki khata mitata hai."
"5724","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ko us ke jism mein takleef dene wali koi cheez nahi pahunchti magar Allah us se us ki buraiyan mita deta hai."
"5725","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ko thakan, gham ya beemari mein se koi cheez nahi pahunchti yahan tak ke fikr jo use fikr ho magar Allah us se us ki buraiyan mita deta hai."
"5726","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meezan mein rakhi jane wali koi cheez husn-e-akhlaq se bhari nahi; aur husn-e-akhlaq wala us se roze aur namaz wale ka darja pa leta hai."
"5727","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Oonton, gaayon ya bakriyon ka koi maalik nahi jo un ki zakaat ada na kare magar wo qayamat ke din sab se bari aur motee aaengi; wo use apne seengon se marengi aur apne khuron se raundengi. Jab bhi un ki pichhli guzar jayegi un ki agli us par wapas aayegi yahan tak ke logon ke darmiyan faisla ho jaye."
"5728","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Oonton ka koi maalik nahi jo un mein un ka haq ada na kare magar wo qayamat ke din sab se zyada aaengi jo kabhi thin aur use chapte pathreelay maidan mein bithaya jayega; wo us par apne pairon aur khuron se charhengi. Aur gaayon ka koi maalik nahi jo un mein un ka haq ada na kare magar wo qayamat ke din sab se zyada aaengi aur use chapte pathreelay maidan mein bithaya jayega; wo use apne seengon se marengi aur apne pairon se raundengi. Aur bakriyon ka koi maalik nahi jo un mein un ka haq ada na kare magar wo qayamat ke din sab se zyada aaengi aur use chapte pathreelay maidan mein bithaya jayega; wo use apne seengon se marengi aur apne khuron se raundengi; un mein beghair seengon wali na hogi na toote seeng wali. Aur khazane ka koi maalik nahi jo us mein us ka haq ada na kare magar us ka khazana qayamat ke din ganja saanp ban kar aayega jo us ka peecha karega apna munh khole hue; phir jab wo us ke paas aayega to us se bhaagega aur us ka Rab azza wa jal use pukarega: Apna khazana lo jo tum ne chhupaya tha; kyunke main tum se ghani hun. Phir jab wo dekhega ke use us se bachna nahi to apna haath us ke munh mein dalega aur wo use oont ki tarah kaatega."
"5729","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sone ya chandi ka koi maalik nahi jo us mein se us ka haq ada na kare magar jab qayamat ka din hoga to us ke liye aag ki chadarein bichhayi jayengi aur unhein jahannam ki aag mein garam kiya jayega; phir us se us ka pehlu, peshani aur peeth daaghi jayegi. Jab bhi thandi hongi us ke liye wapas layi jayengi, aise din mein jis ki miqdar pachaas hazaar saal hai, yahan tak ke bandon ke darmiyan faisla ho jaye; phir wo apna raasta dekhega ya jannat ki taraf ya aag ki taraf. Aur oonton ka koi maalik nahi jo un mein se un ka haq ada na kare, aur un ke haq mein se un ka doodh dohana hai jis din wo pani par aayen, magar jab qayamat ka din hoga to use chapte pathreelay maidan mein litaya jayega sab se zyada halat mein jo kabhi thin; us mein se aik bachcha bhi kam nahi hoga; wo use apne khuron se raundengi aur apne munhon se kaatengi. Jab bhi us par un ki agli guzar jayegi un ki pichhli us par wapas aayegi, aise din mein jis ki miqdar pachaas hazaar saal hai, yahan tak ke bandon ke darmiyan faisla ho jaye; phir wo apna raasta dekhega ya jannat ki taraf ya aag ki taraf. Aur gaayon ya bakriyon ka koi maalik nahi jo un mein se un ka haq ada na kare magar jab qayamat ka din hoga to use chapte pathreelay maidan mein litaya jayega; us mein se kuch kam nahi hoga; un mein mure hue seeng wali na hogi na beghair seengon wali na kati hui; wo use apne seengon se marengi aur apne khuron se raundengi. Jab bhi us par un ki agli guzar jayegi un ki pichhli us par wapas aayegi, aise din mein jis ki miqdar pachaas hazaar saal hai, yahan tak ke bandon ke darmiyan faisla ho jaye; phir wo apna raasta dekhega ya jannat ki taraf ya aag ki taraf."
"5730","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi farz namaz nahi magar us se pehle do rakatein hain."
"5731","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi saal nahi magar jo us ke baad hai us se bura hai yahan tak ke apne Rab se milo."
"5732","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi magar us ke liye aasman mein shohrat hai; phir agar us ki shohrat aasman mein achchi ho to zameen mein rakhi jati hai; aur agar us ki shohrat aasman mein buri ho to zameen mein rakhi jati hai."
"5733","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jo kahe La ilaha illallah phir us par mare magar wo jannat mein dakhil hoga agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho, agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho, agarche Abu Zarr ki naak mitti-aalood ho."
"5734","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jis ki apne qarz ada karne mein niyyat ho magar us ke liye Allah ki taraf se madad hai."
"5735","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi momin banda nahi magar us ke liye gunah hai jo wo waqfe waqfe se karta hai ya gunah hai jis par wo qayam hai aur use nahi chhorta yahan tak ke duniya se juda ho jaye. Beshak momin aazmaish wala, tauba karne wala, bhoolne wala paida kiya gaya hai; jab yaad dilaya jaye to yaad kare."
"5736","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman banda nahi jo wuzu kare aur wuzu mukammal kare phir Allah ke liye har din baarah rakatein nafl parhe farz ke siwa magar Allah us ke liye jannat mein ghar banayega."
"5737","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman banda nahi jo apne bhai ke liye peeth peeche dua kare magar farishta kehta hai: Aur tumhare liye us jaisa."
"5738","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jo gunah kare aur wuzu kare aur paaki achchi kare phir khara ho aur do rakatein parhe phir us gunah se Allah se bakhshish mange magar Allah use bakhsh dega."
"5739","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jo apne haath uthaye........ Allah se sawal mange magar wo use ata karega jab tak wo jaldi na kare ke kahe: Maine manga aur manga aur mujhe kuch nahi diya gaya."
"5740","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jise Allah rewar supurd kare aur wo us din mare jab mare halanke wo apne rewar se dhoka karne wala ho magar Allah ne us par jannat haram ki."
"5741","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jo Allah ko sajda kare magar Allah us se us ka darja buland karta hai aur us se us ki khata mitata hai."
"5742","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jo Allah ko sajda kare magar Allah us ke liye us se neki likhta hai, us se us ki burayi mitata hai aur us ke liye us se darja buland karta hai. Pas sajde kasrat se karo."
"5743","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jo beemari se girne se gire magar Allah use us se paak uthaega."
"5744","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jo mujh par durood bheje magar farishte us par durood bhejte hain jab tak wo mujh par durood bheje; pas banda us mein se kam kahe ya zyada."
"5745","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jo har din ki subah aur har raat ki shaam mein teen baar kahe: Allah ke naam se jis ke naam ke saath zameen mein na aasman mein koi cheez nuqsan nahi deti aur wo sunne wala jaanne wala hai, aur use koi cheez nuqsan pahunchaegi."
"5746","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi lashkar nahi jo Allah ki raah mein jihad kare aur ghanimat paye magar wo aakhirat mein se apne ajr ka do-tehayi jaldi lete hain aur un ke liye teesra baaqi rehta hai. Phir agar wo ghanimat na payen to un ka ajr un ke liye poora hota hai."
"5747","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi dil nahi magar wo Rehman ki ungliyon mein se do ungliyon ke darmiyan latka hua hai; agar chahe use qayam rakhe aur agar chahe use tehra kar de. Aur meezan Rehman ke haath mein hai; wo qaumon ko buland karta hai aur doosron ko past karta hai qayamat ke din tak."
"5748","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum nahi jo Allah ka zikr karti hai magar farishte unhein gher lete hain, rehmat unhein dhaanp leti hai, un par sukoon utarta hai aur Allah un ka zikr un mein karta hai jo us ke paas hain."
"5749","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum nahi jin mein gunaahon par amal ho, wo us ke karne wale se zyada izzat wale aur zyada hon, phir wo use na badlein magar Allah taala unhein us se saza mein aam karega."
"5750","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum nahi jo majlis se khari ho jis mein wo Allah taala ka zikr nahi karti magar wo gadhe ke murdar jaisi se khari hui; aur wo majlis un par qayamat ke din hasrat hogi."
"5751","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har pani se bachcha nahi hota; aur jab Allah kisi cheez ko paida karna chahe to use koi cheez nahi rokti."
"5752","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi momin nahi magar main duniya aur aakhirat mein us ka zyada haqdar hun. Parho agar chaho: Nabi mominon par un ki jaanon se zyada haq rakhte hain. Phir jo momin mare aur maal chhore to us ke asba us ke waris hon jo bhi hon; aur jo qarz ya be-yaar-o-madadgar chhore wo mere paas aaye; kyunke main us ka maula hun."
"5753","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi zakhmi nahi jo Allah ki raah mein zakhmi ho, aur Allah zyada jaanne wala hai jo us ki raah mein zakhmi ho, magar wo qayamat ke din aayega halanke us ka zakhm us ki halat mein hoga jis din zakhmi hua tha: rang khoon ka rang aur khushbu mushk ki khushbu."
"5754","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jo zikr par paak raat guzare aur raat ko ghabra kar uthe aur Allah taala se duniya aur aakhirat ke muamle mein bhalayi mange magar wo use ata karega."
"5755","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jo paaki kare aur paaki mukammal kare jo Allah ne us par likhi hai aur ye paanch namazein parhe magar wo un ke darmiyan ka kaffara hongi."
"5756","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jo wuzu kare aur apna wuzu achcha kare phir khara ho aur do rakatein parhe aur un par apne dil aur chehre se mutawajjeh ho magar us ke liye jannat wajib ho gayi."
"5757","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jo kheti kare ya paudha lagaye aur us mein se parinda, insaan ya janwar khaye magar us se us ke liye sadqa hoga."
"5758","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jise kaanta chubhe ya us se zyada magar us se us ke liye darja likha jayega aur us se us ki khata mitayi jayegi."
"5759","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jis ke liye teen gawahi dein magar us ke liye jannat wajib ho gayi. Kaha gaya: Aur do? Farmaya: Aur do."
"5760","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jo Islam mein safed baal safed kare magar Allah us se us ke liye neki likhta hai aur us se us ki khata mitata hai."
"5761","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jo apne jism mein museebat paye magar Allah taala muhafizon ko hukm deta hai: Mere bande ke liye har din aur raat mein bhalayi mein se likho jo wo karta tha jab tak wo meri qaid mein roka hua hai."
"5762","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jis par ummat namaz parhe magar wo us mein shafaat karenge."
"5763","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jise takleef pahunche, kaanta ya us se zyada, magar Allah us se us ki buraiyan mitata hai jaise darakht apne patte girata hai."
"5764","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jise museebat pahunche aur wo kahe jo Allah ne use hukm diya: Beshak ham Allah ke liye hain aur beshak ham usi ki taraf wapas jane wale hain. Ae Allah, mujhe meri museebat mein ajr de aur mujhe us se behtar badla de, magar Allah use us ki museebat mein ajr dega aur Allah use us se behtar badla dega."
"5765","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jis par zulm ho aur wo lade aur qatl ho magar wo shaheed qatl hua."
"5766","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jo beemar ki ayadat kare jis ki maut hazir na hui ho aur saat baar kahe: Main Allah Azeem se, Arsh-e-Azeem ke Rab se sawal karta hun ke tumhein shifa de, magar use aafiyat di jayegi."
"5767","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jo subah Musalman ki ayadat kare magar us par sattar hazaar farishte durood bhejte hain shaam tak; aur agar shaam ko ayadat kare to us par sattar hazaar farishte durood bhejte hain subah tak; aur us ke liye jannat mein bagh hoga."
"5768","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jo paudha lagaye magar jo us mein se khaya jaye wo us ke liye sadqa hoga; jo us mein se churaya jaye sadqa hoga; jo darinda khaye wo us ke liye sadqa hoga; jo parinde khayen wo us ke liye sadqa hoga; aur use koi kami nahi karta jo us ke liye sadqa ho."
